{"char_end":239,"char_start":32,"chunk_id":"chk_610678f203d4ca30b32b","dataset_version":"","doc_id":"doc_35cde4baed5e2e926dea","location":"智联工业温控机组操作手册（节选） / 1. 产品概述","metadata":{"anchor_backend":"heuristic","anchors":[{"anchor_text":"TCU-900","anchor_type":"entity","chunk_id":"chk_610678f203d4ca30b32b","position_in_chunk":3,"score":1.0},{"anchor_text":"控制主板与远程告警模块","anchor_type":"entity","chunk_id":"chk_610678f203d4ca30b32b","position_in_chunk":45,"score":1.0},{"anchor_text":"AC","anchor_type":"entity","chunk_id":"chk_610678f203d4ca30b32b","position_in_chunk":82,"score":1.0}],"boundary_note":"","chunk_params":{},"chunking":"heading_window","clean_version":"","identity":{"dosage_form":"","generic_name":"","strength":"","version":""},"offset_origin":32,"source_group":"sample_manual"},"source_doc":"智联工业温控机组操作手册（节选）","source_family_id":"","source_hash":"f466dc785004d95073ac8aeebad80649f8a4e06545a2941822f647ecc7bb8ee8","text":"智联 TCU-900 温控机组用于精密产线的循环冷却与过温保护。机组由冷媒回路、循环水泵、控制主板与远程告警模块组成。额定冷却能力为 9.0 kW，工作电源为三相 AC 380 V / 50 Hz。出厂默认将过温保护阈值设置为 65℃，用户可在 45℃ 至 80℃ 之间调整。\n\n本手册覆盖启动前检查、日常运行、过温告警处理与月度维护。操作人员须持有设备主管部门颁发的特种设备作业证，且在近 12 个月内完成复训。","title_path":["智联工业温控机组操作手册（节选）","1. 产品概述"],"token_count":155,"tokenizer_id":"approx-v1"}
{"char_end":486,"char_start":267,"chunk_id":"chk_3a10854a4454c69c67da","dataset_version":"","doc_id":"doc_35cde4baed5e2e926dea","location":"智联工业温控机组操作手册（节选） / 2. 系统架构 / 2.1 模块划分","metadata":{"anchor_backend":"heuristic","anchors":[{"anchor_text":"CMC-12B","anchor_type":"entity","chunk_id":"chk_3a10854a4454c69c67da","position_in_chunk":8,"score":1.0},{"anchor_text":"远程告警模块","anchor_type":"entity","chunk_id":"chk_3a10854a4454c69c67da","position_in_chunk":36,"score":1.0},{"anchor_text":"ALM-04","anchor_type":"entity","chunk_id":"chk_3a10854a4454c69c67da","position_in_chunk":46,"score":1.0}],"boundary_note":"","chunk_params":{},"chunking":"heading_window","clean_version":"","identity":{"dosage_form":"","generic_name":"","strength":"","version":""},"offset_origin":267,"source_group":"sample_manual"},"source_doc":"智联工业温控机组操作手册（节选）","source_family_id":"","source_hash":"f466dc785004d95073ac8aeebad80649f8a4e06545a2941822f647ecc7bb8ee8","text":"控制主板型号为 CMC-12B，负责采集出水温度、回水温度与压缩机电流。远程告警模块型号为 ALM-04，通过 RS-485 接入厂级监控，波特率固定为 9600。循环水泵额定流量 4.5 m³/h，扬程 18 m。冷媒回路使用 R134a，禁止混用其他工质。\n\n当控制主板检测到出水温度连续 8 秒高于保护阈值，会向 ALM-04 发送过温告警帧，同时切断压缩机接触器 KM1。切断后水泵继续运行不少于 120 秒，以便带走换热器余热。","title_path":["智联工业温控机组操作手册（节选）","2. 系统架构","2.1 模块划分"],"token_count":153,"tokenizer_id":"approx-v1"}
